{
 "batchId": "b-0463",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "fr",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_bb26565fe5ebd9c25fb3",
   "sourceHash": "bb26565fe5ebd9c25fb3d3dd4d8fe4632ce4e8b683cb49c2fb7180300dea704f",
   "text": "Des plages préservées au sable doré et aux eaux turquoise.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b363dd02e0dc87e2b2b3",
   "sourceHash": "b363dd02e0dc87e2b2b375fb43eaca72953cd03b58c5d793e1590a044b6b062d",
   "text": "Des stations d’altitude verdoyantes comme Munnar et Wayanad, aux vues à couper le souffle.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f64c648e799e78fdc9c7",
   "sourceHash": "f64c648e799e78fdc9c7e0b3e9a50c367561d4517d96b0daa14bedf9315d88a8",
   "text": "Des backwaters paisibles, où les bateaux-maisons glissent avec grâce sur des eaux tranquilles.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ba9dde625947d0820bde",
   "sourceHash": "ba9dde625947d0820bdea10c7833e820a5f702c70b437e271c87c47b3f26078e",
   "text": "Des forêts denses et des réserves naturelles où abondent une faune et une flore exotiques.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7070dc47f8c547de7bf9",
   "sourceHash": "7070dc47f8c547de7bf9f0ee7e27ec351c39a7e786662b38b32eabf8155afdb1",
   "text": "Patrimoine culturel",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2a84b4fa390f72a44ffa",
   "sourceHash": "2a84b4fa390f72a44ffabf8165c57d918f5afd5545f2723dbddfe0d98cfeddb2",
   "text": "Patrimoine culturel :",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6e09de1549fb47e958da",
   "sourceHash": "6e09de1549fb47e958daeccf409d911c3fb58ddc67f8b4b6002f80eac170885a",
   "text": "Découvrez les arts ancestraux du Kathakali, du Mohiniyattam et du Theyyam.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c25cfcb9f494be058921",
   "sourceHash": "c25cfcb9f494be05892115af23a25a32753b51a367c48173106bd1903ac64b6e",
   "text": "Découvrez des temples, des églises et des palais historiques qui reflètent la riche mosaïque culturelle du Kerala.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_712248bb475b185839fb",
   "sourceHash": "712248bb475b185839fbd3da33ed5364caab10473ea4dfb52e788303f0bde77d",
   "text": "Participez à des fêtes hautes en couleur comme Onam, Vishu et Thrissur Pooram.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bbf47fac6172af494ac9",
   "sourceHash": "bbf47fac6172af494ac9ac351a36756d3203107541902481651b28dfbe78d8ef",
   "text": "Délices culinaires :",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d2d6af23ed057c88d1ff",
   "sourceHash": "d2d6af23ed057c88d1ffe5dc852ed55bd76721a6d3a0d5547adfdfb351406a9f",
   "text": "Savourez la cuisine traditionnelle du Kerala, un mélange harmonieux d’épices, de noix de coco fraîche et d’herbes aromatiques.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_63e05b98b20f64c19af5",
   "sourceHash": "63e05b98b20f64c19af5ff9ceb4f3c20a64a8c2065e7edcb159b441e859d0dd5",
   "text": "Dégustez des plats comme l’appam accompagné de ragoût (stew), le sadya du Kerala et des fruits de mer fraîchement pêchés.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_493140ec1e12270683e8",
   "sourceHash": "493140ec1e12270683e8ed35e8b5f23a3a5901015b69c1786a1162dcecf36c8c",
   "text": "Ayurveda et bien-être",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_85b3760d598986f6ff84",
   "sourceHash": "85b3760d598986f6ff84a43e69fc1b4ad79f0bc251acbd9ab72f2d84260c55aa",
   "text": "Ayurveda et bien-être :",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f4834149533ec326a37c",
   "sourceHash": "f4834149533ec326a37c20b9f8fb681487579e0a630157542c8e6751fbbdfaa2",
   "text": "Le Kerala est le berceau de l’Ayurveda et propose des traitements et des thérapies authentiques.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cfe58d0716c3b4b8da50",
   "sourceHash": "cfe58d0716c3b4b8da50e6c4a92d0843a0b2d206b154542f299906aadf31479d",
   "text": "Ressourcez votre corps et votre esprit grâce aux massages ayurvédiques, aux programmes de détoxification et aux traitements de Panchakarma.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c8d6b2795d35c04f4029",
   "sourceHash": "c8d6b2795d35c04f402992252b0d087a13af81f414a878d3203fb94e8f8ca5a2",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village : votre porte d’entrée vers le bien-être",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_651249997fda8d307de6",
   "sourceHash": "651249997fda8d307de6f535fc63b7ba55bd7eb95557b1dd1d40c11270d1654f",
   "text": "Située dans les paysages paisibles de Palakkad, Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village associe de manière unique les thérapies ayurvédiques traditionnelles à des installations de bien-être modernes. C’est le lieu idéal pour vous imprégner des pratiques globales de l’Ayurveda tout en découvrant la beauté du Kerala.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b39d13e0e100db42652f",
   "sourceHash": "b39d13e0e100db42652f478a0c7fdbc7799a4310cd410792ff12c97fb2fcd1dc",
   "text": "Ce que nous proposons :",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f694067f2f28bc7c2c19",
   "sourceHash": "f694067f2f28bc7c2c1912b3987d3d730de03d214253d48e6c188be509a4be24",
   "text": "Des thérapies ayurvédiques authentiques",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3c66615adf5446fd8e06",
   "sourceHash": "3c66615adf5446fd8e06f73296c16edcb793b2d38faa45bdef2cef4b92ca1f70",
   "text": ": bénéficiez de traitements personnalisés tels que l’Abhyangam, le Shirodhara et le Panchakarma, sous la conduite de thérapeutes experts.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7a7866742b8ba6b01be1",
   "sourceHash": "7a7866742b8ba6b01be1c21a0aa4cb0d546926ff52605e39286ae4933bf9c76a",
   "text": "Des thérapies ayurvédiques authentiques : bénéficiez de traitements personnalisés tels que l’Abhyangam, le Shirodhara et le Panchakarma, sous la conduite de thérapeutes experts.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_063f88718abb9b7abae0",
   "sourceHash": "063f88718abb9b7abae017434505ad9a0c51d37b4d2ee89552f7a4a1f83d4c37",
   "text": ": participez à des séances quotidiennes pour vous reconnecter à vous-même, guidées par des instructeurs expérimentés.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a468cfe722d8c9179c31",
   "sourceHash": "a468cfe722d8c9179c3172e33e97cf5a12913577328b381c0a6f2afb8fee5099",
   "text": "Yoga et méditation : participez à des séances quotidiennes pour vous reconnecter à vous-même, guidées par des instructeurs expérimentés.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5d569611d9b29ee60453",
   "sourceHash": "5d569611d9b29ee60453ca1249aa0986e4716df7040f854df20d64cd3853b41e",
   "text": "Des programmes de bien-être globaux",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
